{
  "name": "Automated EU VIES VAT Number Validator & Reverse Charge Tax Auditor — Daily B2B Data & Compliance Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated EU VIES VAT Number Validator & Reverse Charge Tax Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nValidates European Union & Northern Ireland (XI) corporate VAT numbers in real time via the official EU Commission VIES REST API and local regex checksums. Audits Intra-EU Reverse Charge eligibility and generates Markdown compliance certificates.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d3c31744-69cf-5364-ba04-9d45a55d9a7d",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "de63611f-d8f4-589f-a75c-bdb953a39591",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~eu-vies-vat-tax-compliance-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"vat_numbers\": [\n    \"IE6388047V\",\n    \"DE118607914\",\n    \"FR40303265045\"\n  ],\n  \"requester_vat\": \"\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
